OL,5,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FBea returns to Mum's flat, furious
OL,7,     Fover Judith-Anne lying to her. Val
OL,8,     Fcalls the police. Monica tries to
OL,9,     Fshow her dominance over the women
OL,10,     Fwith a sit-in.
OL,11,G0100 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FLizzie tells Doreen she intends to
OL,13,     Ftry to get back in Monica's
OL,14,     Ffavour. Bea feels worse for wear
OL,15,     Fafter a night's drinking. She and
OL,16,     FVal are interrupted by Yvonne, the
OL,17,     Fgirl next door.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
